        "name": "Repudiation",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Ambessa gains a shield, briefly braces herself, and then slams the ground to damage nearby enemies. If she blocked any non-minion damage while bracing herself, this ability will deal increased damage.",
        "bodyHtml": "Ambessa gains <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(150% bonus Attack Damage) Shield</span> for 1.5 seconds and braces herself for 0.5 seconds. She then slams the ground, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(50/75/100/125/150 + (50% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> to nearby enemies, which increases to <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(75/112.5/150/187.5/225 + (75% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> if she braced herself from damage from an enemy champion, large monster, or structure.",
