        "name": "Public Execution",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Ambessa blinks to the farthest enemy champion in a line of her choosing and suppresses them upon her arrival. She then slams the enemy into the ground where they take damage and are stunned.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive</span>: Ambessa gains <span>10/20/30% Armor Penetration</span> and her Abilities <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">heal her for (15/17.5/20% + (50% Lifesteal)) of the damage she dealt</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active</span>: Ambessa becomes <span>Unstoppable</span> and blinks to the farthest enemy champion in a line, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Suppressing</span> the target for 0.75 seconds and then slamming them into the ground, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(150/250/350 + (80% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunning</span> them for 0.4 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Healing is 25% effective against minions and 25% effective against monsters.</span>",
